<title>USA: Alternative Resources enlarges board.</title>
<headline>Alternative Resources enlarges board.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNSHIRE, Ill. 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alternative Resources Corp, which provides technical staff to information service businesses, said it named A. Donald Rully to its board, increasing the six to six members.</p>
<p>Rully previously was with International Business Machines Corp, most recently directing business strategy for IBM's Integrated Systems Solutions Corp before retiring.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
